{"id": "EUVD-2026-97887", "enisaUuid": "c672f40c-8934-3f77-9e17-55f32b99fff2", "description": "LearnHouse before 1.4.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in POST /api/v1/playgrounds/{uuid}/duplicate that skips the read-access and draft checks enforced by get_playground. Authenticated users with playground creation rights, such as Instructors, who know a RESTRICTED or unpublished playground UUID can copy its html_content and republish it publicly.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T20:55:17", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:46:42", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/learnhouse/learnhouse/pull/1120", "https://github.com/learnhouse/learnhouse/commit/9a1319185a596ea9b40651dbfd96f05195c0be37", "https://github.com/learnhouse/learnhouse", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/learnhouse-before-1.4.0-missing-authorization-via-playground-duplicate-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109564", "GHSA-gcg2-9m45-j9r6"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.19, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2ad94040-ad27-39ae-b938-902ee6a5f820", "product": {"name": "LearnHouse", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.4.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "6eb75b32-ae31-34b8-82ea-39d461f47952", "vendor": {"name": "learnhouse"}}], "isExploited": false}